# Amatic environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (same directory, sibling of package.json) and fill in
# the three keys. `.env.local` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Verify with the backend running:  curl localhost:3001/health   -> keys present
#                                   curl localhost:3001/readyz   -> keys actually work
#
# Docs: docs/01-getting-started.md

# --- Required for any AI feature -------------------------------------------
# Teaching brain + drawing recognition. https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Image generation. GOOGLE_GEMINI_API_KEY is also accepted.
GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=
# Voice output. Not required when TTS_PROVIDER=kokoro (see below).
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: ports and environment ---------------------------------------
# AI_SERVER_PORT=3001
# VITE_APP_PORT=3000
# NODE_ENV=production        # suppresses error detail in API responses

# --- Optional: logging (docs/18 Phase 2.1) ---------------------------------
# LOG_LEVEL=info             # trace|debug|info|warn|error|fatal
# LOG_PRETTY=1               # human-readable logs in a terminal (dev only)

# --- Optional: teaching brain output mode (docs/18 Phase 3.2) --------------
# json  = the ADR-003 text scanner (default)
# tools = typed tool calls, validated by the API
# MASTER_OUTPUT_MODE=json

# --- Optional: speech (docs/18 Phase 3.4, docs/08-voice-pipeline.md) -------
# elevenlabs (default, needs the key above) | kokoro (local, no key, no cost)
# TTS_PROVIDER=elevenlabs
# KOKORO_VOICE=af_heart
# KOKORO_DTYPE=q8            # q8 (~90 MB, fast) | fp32 (larger, best quality)
# TTS_CACHE_DIR=amatic-app/.cache/tts
# TTS_CACHE_MAX_MB=200

# --- Optional: images (docs/18 Phase 3.3) ----------------------------------
# DIAGRAM_LIBRARY_DIR=amatic-app/diagram-library
# Generated images per teaching turn. Default 1 — image generation is the
# dominant cost line. Raise as the vetted diagram library fills.
# VITE_MAX_IMAGES_PER_TURN=1
